== 4. Using Templates

=== 4.1 Document Header Template

'''Purpose:''' Standardize page metadata

'''Usage:'''
```mediawiki
{{Document_Header
|title=Page Title
|type=Concept
|author=Your Name
|date=2026-02-13
|confidence=0.75
|status=Emerging
}}
```

'''Result:'''
* Adds epistemic marker
* Sets SMW properties
* Displays metadata box

=== 4.2 Infobox Templates

'''Infobox_Concept:'''
```mediawiki
{{Infobox_Concept
|title=Recursive Systems
|definition=Systems that reference themselves
|examples=Fractals, Feedback loops
|domain=Systems Science
|confidence=0.80
|status=Established
}}
```

'''Infobox_Project:'''
```mediawiki
{{Infobox_Project
|title=BITwiki Development
|description=Building recursive knowledge infrastructure
|status=Active
|steward=Hyperion
|confidence=0.90
}}
```

=== 4.3 Epistemic Templates

'''Epistemic_Marker:'''
```mediawiki
{{Epistemic_Marker
|confidence=High
|evidence=Primary sources
|status=Verified
}}
```

'''Uncertainty_Marker:'''
```mediawiki
{{Uncertainty_Marker
|type=Measurement
|value=10.5
|uncertainty=±0.2
|confidence=0.85
}}
```

=== 4.4 Query Templates

'''Related_Entities:'''
```mediawiki
{{Related_Entities
|entity={{FULLPAGENAME}}
|limit=10
}}
```

'''Domain_Index:'''
```mediawiki
{{Domain_Index
|domain=Systems Science
|limit=20
}}
```

